                <div><div style="font-size:24px; font-weight:900; color:#ff8a8a;">${highRisks}</div><div class="hint">高风险</div></div>
                <div><div style="font-size:18px; font-weight:800; color:var(--muted2);">${peerRiskAvg}</div><div class="hint">同行均值</div></div>
                <span class="badge ${riskCmp.tone}">${riskCmp.txt}</span>
              </div>
              <div style="margin-top:10px;" class="hint">越少越好。若 ≥ 同行均值，说明合规与触达条件需要清理。</div>
